{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"Antonio Canales, bailaor","2021 marcó la vuelta al candelero y a los escenarios de Antonio Canales, renacido como ave Fénix tras su descenso a los infiernos. Figura única del baile flamenco, reconocible personalidad que llegó a lo más alto de su profesión adquiriendo fama mundial, Canales lleva 30 años pisando fuerte en su arte sin igual, que esta película repasa a través de vanguardistas y apabullantes puestas en escena, de imágenes de archivo, de sus propias palabras y de testimonios de personalidades como Cayetana Martínez de Irujo, Jorge Javier Vázquez, Soleá Morente o Antonio Dechent.",[4,5,6,7],"artistic creation","personal memory","regional identity","legacy",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":27,"media":31,"synopsis":34,"production":35,"characters":38,"roles":39,"awards":57,"tags":3},"Film","ES2023_102","es2023-102-antonio-canales-bailaor",{"native":1,"english":13},"",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-05-19",2023,"Documentary",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Raúl Rosillo","raul-rosillo",0,"Male identifying","Spain",[],[28,29,30],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Performative mode","Biopic",{"posterUrl":32,"trailerUrl":33},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt23184706/mediaviewer/rm3611231233/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/evideos.php?movie_id=448154",{"native":2,"english":13},[36],{"country":25,"share":37},"Majority coproducer",[],[40,47,53],{"person":41,"role":46},{"id":42,"slug":43,"name":42,"birthYear":44,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":45},"Antonio Canales","antonio-canales",1961,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":48,"role":46},{"id":49,"slug":50,"name":49,"birthYear":51,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":52},"Antonio Dechent","antonio-dechent",1